"┌ worktree-purge ── /home/dev ───────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"╭ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮│"
"│                                                                           ││"
"│  ↑ ↓ j k     move cursor                                                  ││"
"│  ← h         collapse group / go to header                                ││"
"│  → l         expand group / enter it                                      ││"
"│  Enter       toggle group                                                 ││"
"│  g G         jump to top / bottom                                         ││"
"│                                                                           ││"
"│  Space       select worktree (on a header: whole group)                   ││"
"│  a           select all in this repo                                      ││"
"│  A           select all everywhere                                        ││"
"│                                                                           ││"
"│  d x         purge selected (or the row under the cursor)                 ││"
"│  s           cycle sort: name / size / active                             ││"
"│  r           rescan                                                       ││"
"│  ? Esc q     help / close / quit                                          ││"
"│                                                                           ││"
"│  ● uncommitted changes — lost on removal                                  ││"
"│  ● unpushed commits — kept, they live in the repository                   ││"
"│  ⚑ stashes — kept, never blocks a purge                                   ││"
"│                                                                           ││"
"│  Removal asks twice: y confirms, then F forces anything that holds work.  ││"
"╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯│"
"└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
